>
> 条件/判断类：碰撞停止(collision_stop), 互换原型(toggle_to_alternate_prototype), 少数图案为蓝图(minority_pattern_as_blueprint), 遇阻停止(stop_at_blocker), 跨面板搬运(cross_panel_move), 前景背景分别替换(fg_bg_separate), 路径及相交房间(path_and_rooms), 最深与最浅列唯一(unique_deep_shallow), 最短路径选择(shortest_path_selection), 空缺借邻色填充(gap_borrows_neighbor), 色与高反向轮转(color_height_rotate), 对角放置(diagonal_placement), 标记定输出朝向(marker_fixes_orientation), 整块移动保持内容(block_move_intact), 各区域缺像素(region_miss_pixel), 边界对齐(edge_alignment), 槽位位置决定颜色(slot_position_color), 对侧面板色(opposite_panel_color), 分隔色填充间隙(sep_color_fills_gap), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 两侧计数决定长度(side_counts_length)
